      "content": "but even that relief you're talking about... it feels impossible. everything is just so heavy. i look at my life and there's nothing left. it's like i've been running on empty for years and now there's just a void. sometimes i think maybe not waking up isn't even a bad thing, it just sounds... peaceful. like finally being able to rest without any more struggle.",
